Welcome to Alpine!

Let's test your VK Capsula (you can use commands):

mic-speaker-test   - microphone and speakers (including 3.5mm jack)
clockdisp          - display
touch-keys         - touch buttons
ringled            - LED ring (below buttons)
lightmon           - light sensor
bt-pair            - Bluetooth pairing (lets use Capsula as BT speaker)

Have fun :)

